[ti:Neon Psalm]
[00:06.00]♪
[00:08.00]Neon psalm for the wanderers
[00:12.00]Glowing letters on the rain
[00:16.00]Read it slowly, read it louder
[00:20.00]Say my name and say it again
[00:24.00]Bass is shaking every window
[00:28.00]Hearts are open, doors are too
[00:32.00]Write a psalm in violet neon
[00:36.00]Every word of it is you
[00:40.00]♪
